        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we market limited amounts of our production to various premium-priced specialty markets, such as foundry cokemakers, manufacturers of activated carbon products, and specialty metals producers.",
        "start_character": 28491,
        "end_character": 28697
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Contiguous to the Brook Mine, the Company operates a carbon research facility related to the production of advanced carbon products and materials from coal.",
        "start_character": 1467,
        "end_character": 1623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also focused on the development of rare earth elements and critical minerals, including gallium, germanium and scandium which are, from time to time subject to strict export licensing requirements and changing destination-specific restrictions (including export bans or restrictions to the United States imposed by the Chinese government), as well as the potential commercialization of coal-to-carbon-based products and materials.",
        "start_character": 14025,
        "end_character": 14462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "however, we also have the ability to develop on controlled property a rail-loading facility on the Norfolk Southern railroad, which would facilitate dual rail service.",
        "start_character": 17150,
        "end_character": 17317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Due to these regulations, we will incur costs to design and implement blast schedules and to conduct pre-blast surveys and blast monitoring.",
        "start_character": 76030,
        "end_character": 76170
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, we may seek to sell greater amounts of our coal into the power-generation market in the future.",
        "start_character": 56359,
        "end_character": 56463
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2020, we suspended development at the Berwind Complex",
        "start_character": 20142,
        "end_character": 20198
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2020, we suspended development at the Berwind Complex due to lower pricing and demand largely caused by the COVID-19 outbreak.",
        "start_character": 3367,
        "end_character": 3496
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020479-768010e1ec7522d1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the USFWS has identified bald eagle habitats in some of the counties where we operate.",
