        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to utilize the increased capacity, we also began development work on additional low-cost, high- volatile mines at Elk Creek, which were fully in production by the end of the third quarter of 2024.",
